# AWS Lambda Execution Role with S3 Read Permissions

Here's a complete JSON CloudFormation template snippet:

```json
{
  "AWSTemplateFormatVersion": "2010-09-09",
  "Description": "CloudFormation template for Lambda execution role with S3 read permissions",
  "Resources": {
    "LambdaExecutionRole": {
      "Type": "AWS::IAM::Role",
      "Properties": {
        "AssumeRolePolicyDocument": {
          "Version": "2012-10-17",
          "Statement": [
            {
              "Effect": "Allow",
              "Principal": {
                "Service": "lambda.amazonaws.com"
              },
              "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ManagedPolicyArns": [
          "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole"
        ],
        "Policies": [
          {
            "PolicyName": "S3ReadPolicy",
            "PolicyDocument": {
              "Version": "2012-10-17",
              "Statement": [
                {
                  "Effect": "Allow",
                  "Action": [
                    "s3:GetObject",
                    "s3:ListBucket"
                  ],
                  "Resource": [
                    "arn:aws:s3:::my-bucket",
                    "arn:aws:s3:::my-bucket/*"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "RoleName": "LambdaS3ReadRole",
        "Tags": [
          {
            "Key": "Environment",
            "Value": "Development"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "Outputs": {
    "LambdaExecutionRoleArn": {
      "Description": "ARN of the Lambda execution role",
      "Value": {
        "Fn::GetAtt": [
          "LambdaExecutionRole",
          "Arn"
        ]
      },
      "Export": {
        "Name": "LambdaExecutionRoleArn"
      }
    },
    "LambdaExecutionRoleName": {
      "Description": "Name of the Lambda execution role",
      "Value": {
        "Ref": "LambdaExecutionRole"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Key Components Explained:

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| **AssumeRolePolicyDocument** | Allows Lambda service to assume this role |
| **AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole** | AWS managed policy for CloudWatch Logs |
| **S3ReadPolicy** | Custom inline policy for S3 read access |
| **s3:GetObject** | Permission to read objects from S3 |
| **s3:ListBucket** | Permission to list bucket contents |

## Usage Notes:

⚠️ **Important**: Replace `my-bucket` with your actual S3 bucket name

You can use this role ARN when creating a Lambda function:

```json
{
  "Type": "AWS::Lambda::Function",
  "Properties": {
    "Role": { "Fn::GetAtt": ["LambdaExecutionRole", "Arn"] },
    ...
  }
}
```
